  "detail": [],
  "id": "kesslercontaineryard",
  "note": "KESSLER CONTAINER YARD — a container yard off Kessler Street.\n\nThe tile's prose: intermodal boxes stacked four high in sun-bleached reds and blues, aisles between\nthem like canyons, a reach-stacker sitting idle with its keys long gone; half the containers empty\nand the other half nobody will open on record.\n\nSo the tile is rows of containers at four high, with two aisles running back from the street, and\nthe reach-stacker parked in the front aisle with its boom lowered: a yellow body, a cab and a\nspreader beam. No fence and no sign. A floodlight mast stands at the corner.\n\nIt stands in for the `interstack` arm (`replaces`), which stays in LEGACY_MODELS.",
  "pal": "ty_yard_tarmac",
  "replaces": "interstack",
